sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Fan
  participant CF as CloudFront + WAF
  participant GW as API Gateway (JWT)
  participant API as Fargate API
  participant Q as SQS FIFO join-queue
  participant QM as queue-manager (Scheduler, 1 min)
  participant D as DynamoDB live-queue
  participant DB as RDS PostgreSQL
  participant T as SNS order-events -> SQS ticket-queue
  participant TF as ticket-fn
  participant S3 as S3 tickets/
  participant SES as SES

  Fan->>CF: POST /api/waiting-room/{concert}/join
  CF->>GW: forward (no cache)
  GW->>API: verified access token
  API->>Q: SendMessage (group = concertId, dedup = user#concert)
  API-->>Fan: 202 pending
  QM->>Q: receive joins in arrival order
  QM->>D: assign position (WAITING)
  loop every few seconds
    Fan->>API: GET /status
    API->>D: GetItem
    API-->>Fan: waiting, peopleAhead
  end
  QM->>D: admit next 500 per concert (ADMITTED, 15-min expiry)
  Fan->>API: POST /api/checkout/holds (seatIds)
  API->>D: isAdmitted?
  alt not admitted
    API-->>Fan: 403 not_admitted
  else admitted
    API->>DB: one transaction: UPDATE seats (available or expired hold), insert pending order
    alt every seat updated
      API-->>Fan: hold created, expires in 10 min
    else any seat taken
      API-->>Fan: 409 seats_unavailable (nothing held)
    end
  end
  Fan->>API: POST /holds/{id}/confirm (simulated payment)
  API->>DB: seats held -> sold, order confirmed (one transaction)
  API->>T: publish OrderConfirmed
  API-->>Fan: 200 confirmed
  T->>TF: SQS batch (partial batch failures, DLQ after 5)
  TF->>S3: PutObject tickets/{orderId}.pdf (If-None-Match *)
  TF->>SES: send e-ticket email
  Fan->>API: GET /api/me/tickets/{id}/download
  API-->>Fan: pre-signed S3 URL (300 s)
